<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to NestJS Auth</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Welcome to NestJS Auth!</h2>
    </div>
    
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    
    <p>Thank you for registering with NestJS Auth. We're excited to have you on board!</p>
    
    <p>You can now log in to your account using your email and password:</p>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Log In</a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
    
    <p>Best regards,<br>The NestJS Auth Team</p>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated email, please do not reply.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>